      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am 80% sure this problem 👉🏻 https://feedback.vrchat.com/localization/p/some-strings-about-posts-of-groups-are-not-translatable\n\nhappened because when they renamed \"announcements\" to \"posts\" they by accident also broke/renamed the keys.\n\n\"1:1 English as keys\" can easily cause those problems, but mistakes like this one is easier to notice, when keys are structured, and original English language is being applied to the client UI the same way as any other language.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
